      "Question": "Which of the following can be said to be essentially the parts of Inclusive Governance? 1. Permitting the Non-Banking Financial Companies to do banking 2. Establishing effective District Planning Committees in all the districts 3. Increasing government spending on public health 4. Strengthening the Mid-day Meal Scheme Choose the correct answer:",
