      "Topic": "IIP & Core Industries",
      "Topic ID": "ECO-U06-T01",
      "Question": "What is the importance of the term “Interest Coverage Ratio” of a firm in India? 1. It help in understanding the present risk of a firm that a bank is going to give loan to. 2. It helps in evaluating the emerging risk of a firm that a bank is going to give loan to. 3. The higher a borrowing firm’s level of Interest Coverage Ratio, the worse is its ability to service its debt. Select the correct answer using the code given below:",
