      "Question": "With reference to Indian economy, demand pull-inflation can be caused/increased by which of the following? 1. Expansionary policies 2. Fiscal stimulus 3. Inflation-indexing wages 4. Higher - purchasing power 5. Rising interest rates Select the correct answer using the codes given below.",
