      "Topic": "Motion & Gravitation",
      "Topic ID": "GSC-U01-T01",
      "Question": "Consider the following statements - If there were no phenomenon of capillarity 1. It would be difficult to use a kerosene lamp 2. One would not be able to use a straw to consume a soft drink 3. The blotting paper would fail to function 4. The big trees that we see around would not have grown on the earth",
