      "Subject": "General Science",
      "Unit": "Biology",
      "Topic": "Cell Biology",
      "Topic ID": "GSC-U03-T01",
      "Question": "Consider the following minerals - 1. Calcium 2. Iron 3. Sodium Which of the minerals given above is/are required by the human body for the contraction of muscles?",
